{a)  By  obeying  Him  man  proceedeth  not  by  the  path  of  destruction.

{b)  Man  proceedeth  by  the  broad,  not  the  narrow  way.

This  is  explained  to  mean — does  not  wander  in  transmigration.

®  Panch,  literally  five.  The  number  conveys  the  idea  of  selection.
There  is  a  Hindustani  proverb.  Panchon  nmi  Parameshwar  hat,
Where  five  are  assembled,  God  is  in  the  midst  of  them.  Others  say
